I'm trying to improve the scanf documentation in glibc regarding the "'" and
possibly "I" flags: https://sourceware.org/ml/libc-help/2015-10/msg00003.html

The scanf(3) page seems to be a partial copy of the glibc texinfo manual, so
the improvements should apply to it.

I'm using this bug as a remainder; for now, I think we should wait until the
glibc manual is updated.

